		{"id":"d19621b68400a31d","x":1280,"y":280,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"\"I've heard vampire pregnancies take longer.\" Lilith said.\n\n\"You aren't sure?\"\n\n\"Well I've never been pregnant myself. So no.\"\n\n\"Don't want kids?\" Sara asked.\n\n\"I do, it's just... not been the right time yet.\"\n\nSara rubbed her belly and nodded, \"Timing is everything, that's for sure.\" "}
